  "description": "26\" Electric Beach Cruiser Bike – Beyond Pro\nIntroducing the Tracer Classic Stretch Chopper Hi-Ten Steel Electric Bike – the ultimate blend of style, power, and comfort. Featuring a sleek design and robust performance, it’s built to turn heads and deliver an unforgettable ride.\nEquipped with a Tracer Classical Springer Disc Brake fork and a Springer Suspension shock, you'll experience a smooth and comfortable ride, even on bumpy roads.\nThe Alloy 25.4mmx200mm seatpost and Vacuum elastic PVC leather+high density PU foam with springs saddle offer a comfortable and customizable riding experience, while the Nylon Platform one-piece PP pedals provide durability and traction.\nThis electric bike features a toggle switch that allows you to easily switch between three levels of assist, providing you with a faster ride and a smooth cycling experience.\nEquipped with a powerful 48V 800W light weight high speed brushless rear hub motor and a LG Lithium Li-ion 48V/17.5Ah battery, this electric bike can travel up to 30 miles on pure electric mode and reach a maximum speed of 25 miles per hour.\nthe Tracer Classic Stretch Chopper Hi-Ten Steel Electric Bike is a powerful, stylish, and comfortable electric bike that offers a smooth and efficient riding experience. With its impressive range, speed, and performance, this electric bike is perfect for anyone looking for an eco-friendly and efficient mode of transportation.",
